    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "Mo\u017cesz doda\u0107 swoje urz\u0105dzenia za pomoc\u0105 automatycznego skanowania, kodu QR, kodu konfiguracyjnego lub katalogu r\u0119cznego.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "Uzyskaj szczeg\u00f3\u0142owe informacje na temat swoich urz\u0105dze\u0144 i wskaz\u00f3wki dotycz\u0105ce energii.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
    "Cihaz\u0131 Do\u011frula": "Sprawd\u017a urz\u0105dzenie", // EN: Verify Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 Se\u00e7": "Wybierz Urz\u0105dzenie", // EN: Select Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r": "Usu\u0144 urz\u0105dzenie", // EN: Remove device
    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Dlaczego moje urz\u0105dzenie wy\u015bwietla si\u0119 jako offline?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Wpisz adres IP urz\u0105dzenia, a NEXUS dowie si\u0119, jakim protoko\u0142em si\u0119 ono obs\u0142uguje.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Sprawd\u017a po\u0142\u0105czenie Wi-Fi urz\u0105dzenia i router.Je\u015bli problem b\u0119dzie si\u0119 powtarza\u0142, usu\u0144 urz\u0105dzenie i dodaj je ponownie.Kroki: Urz\u0105dzenia > wybierz urz\u0105dzenie > Usu\u0144.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Sprawd\u017a po\u0142\u0105czenie Wi-Fi urz\u0105dzenia i router.Je\u015bli problem b\u0119dzie si\u0119 powtarza\u0142, usu\u0144 urz\u0105dzenie z aplikacji NEXUS i dodaj je ponownie.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Je\u015bli Twoje urz\u0105dzenie si\u0119 nie pojawi, u\u017cyj skanowania QR lub kodu konfiguracyjnego.Mo\u017cesz otworzy\u0107 stron\u0119 pomocy, aby uzyska\u0107 wsparcie i wskaz\u00f3wki.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Us\u0142uga lokalizacji (GPS) na Twoim urz\u0105dzeniu jest wy\u0142\u0105czona.W\u0142\u0105cz go i spr\u00f3buj ponownie.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Twoje urz\u0105dzenie nie obs\u0142uguje us\u0142ug lokalizacyjnych.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Urz\u0105dzenia nie ma na li\u015bcie?Wy\u015blij opini\u0119", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
    "Cihaz\u0131n yerel anahtar\u0131 gerekir \u2014 yak\u0131nda": "Potrzebuje klucza lokalnego urz\u0105dzenia \u2014 ju\u017c wkr\u00f3tce", // EN: Needs the device's local key — coming soon
    "Cihaz\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n \u00fczerindeki 8 haneli kodu girin.": "Wprowad\u017a 8-cyfrowy kod na swoim urz\u0105dzeniu.", // EN: Enter the 8-digit code on your device.
