    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Zarz\u0105dzaj o\u015bwietleniem w swoim domu, w jednym pomieszczeniu, w jednym pomieszczeniu.W\u0142\u0105czanie/wy\u0142\u0105czanie, jasno\u015b\u0107, temperatura barwowa i szybkie skr\u00f3ty do scen w jednej aplikacji.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Podaj gotowe polecenia, szybkie automatyzacje i sugestie inteligentnych aplikacji na podstawie urz\u0105dze\u0144 w domu.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Utw\u00f3rz aplikacj\u0119 zapewniaj\u0105c\u0105 komfort klimatyczny, kt\u00f3ra zarz\u0105dza klimatyzacj\u0105 i termostatami w Twoim domu z jednego panelu.Obejmuj\u0105 kontrol\u0119 temperatury, tryby szybkie, tryb ekologiczny i dzia\u0142ania oparte na pomieszczeniu.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
