    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131k kald\u0131k\u00e7a e\u015fle\u015fme ge\u00e7erli kal\u0131r (tepsi/arka plan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 destekler).": "Most musi by\u0107 pod\u0142\u0105czony do tej samej sieci Wi-Fi, co Twoje urz\u0105dzenie iOS.Parowanie pozostaje wa\u017cne tak d\u0142ugo, jak komputer nie \u015bpi (obs\u0142ugiwana jest praca w zasobniku/w tle).", // EN: The bridge has to be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. The pairing stays valid as long as your computer stays awake (tray/background operation supported).
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Ba\u015flat": "Uruchom most", // EN: Start the bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Naci\u015bnij okr\u0105g\u0142y przycisk na mostku i spr\u00f3buj ponownie.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Naci\u015bnij okr\u0105g\u0142y przycisk na g\u00f3rze mostu, a nast\u0119pnie w ci\u0105gu 30 sekund dotknij \u201ePo\u0142\u0105cz most\u201d.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Nie mo\u017cna po\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 si\u0119 z mostem.Upewnij si\u0119, \u017ce jeste\u015b w tej samej sieci i spr\u00f3buj ponownie.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
