    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "Dodawanie urz\u0105dze\u0144 Matter wymaga kontrolera Matter, kt\u00f3rego NEXUS jeszcze nie oferuje.Je\u015bli urz\u0105dzenie \u0142\u0105czy si\u0119 przez Wi-Fi, mo\u017cesz doda\u0107 je z sieci lokalnej wed\u0142ug jego adresu IP.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
