    "Misafir a\u011f\u0131 ayarlan\u0131nca burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Pojawi si\u0119 tutaj po skonfigurowaniu sieci dla go\u015bci.", // EN: It will appear here once the guest network is set up.
    "Misafir a\u011f\u0131 veya ge\u00e7ici eri\u015fim bilgisi olmadan haz\u0131r durum g\u00f6stermiyoruz.": "Nie pokazujemy stanu gotowo\u015bci bez informacji o sieci go\u015bcinnej i tymczasowym dost\u0119pie.", // EN: We don't show a ready state without guest network or temporary access details.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma ve ortak alan cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rlayan bir misafir modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Kar\u015f\u0131lama \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131, sessiz bildirim ve misafir eri\u015fim ad\u0131mlar\u0131 olsun.": "Utw\u00f3rz aplikacj\u0119 w trybie go\u015bcia, kt\u00f3ra przygotuje urz\u0105dzenia wej\u015bciowe, o\u015bwietlenie i powierzchnie wsp\u00f3lne zaraz po przybyciu go\u015bci.Do\u0142\u0105cz \u015bwiat\u0142o powitalne, ciche powiadomienia i stopnie dost\u0119pu dla go\u015bci.", // EN: Create a guest mode app that prepares the entrance, lighting and shared-area devices as soon as guests arrive. Include a welcome light, quiet notifications and guest access steps.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda kullan\u0131lacak \u0131\u015f\u0131k, eri\u015fim ve ortam ayarlar\u0131.": "Ustawienia o\u015bwietlenia, dost\u0119pu i nastroju, z kt\u00f3rych mo\u017cna skorzysta\u0107 zaraz po przybyciu go\u015bci.", // EN: Light, access and ambience settings to use as soon as guests arrive.
    "Misafir gelmeden \u00f6nce giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma, ortak alan ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde haz\u0131rla. Ev i\u00e7inde rahat ama g\u00fcvenli bir kar\u015f\u0131lama ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Przygotuj wej\u015bcie, o\u015bwietlenie, obszary wsp\u00f3lne i urz\u0105dzenia rozrywkowe na jednym panelu przed przybyciem go\u015bci.Stw\u00f3rz w domu zrelaksowan\u0105, ale bezpieczn\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 powitaln\u0105.", // EN: Prepare the entrance, lighting, shared areas and entertainment devices on one panel before guests arrive. Create a relaxed but secure welcome flow at home.
