    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Trwa wyszukiwanie urz\u0105dzenia w tej samej sieci i parowanie.Mo\u017ce to potrwa\u0107 do minuty;urz\u0105dzenie musi by\u0107 w\u0142\u0105czone i znajdowa\u0107 si\u0119 w trybie parowania.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nie znaleziono urz\u0105dzenia lub nie mo\u017cna go sparowa\u0107.Upewnij si\u0119, \u017ce jest w tej samej sieci, w\u0142\u0105czony i w trybie parowania.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Nie znaleziono urz\u0105dzenia.Upewnij si\u0119, \u017ce jest w tej samej sieci, w\u0142\u0105czony i w trybie parowania.Zapora sieciowa Twojego komputera mo\u017ce blokowa\u0107 odpowiedzi z urz\u0105dze\u0144 w sieci lokalnej.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Nie uda\u0142o si\u0119 sparowa\u0107 urz\u0105dzenia.Sprawd\u017a kod parowania i czy urz\u0105dzenie znajduje si\u0119 w trybie parowania.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Urz\u0105dzenie jest sparowane, ale nie ma funkcji, kt\u00f3rymi NEXUS mo\u017ce sterowa\u0107.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Urz\u0105dzenie nie odpowiedzia\u0142o.Upewnij si\u0119, \u017ce jest on w\u0142\u0105czony i znajduje si\u0119 w tej samej sieci.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
