    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Oczywi\u015bcie!Mog\u0119 u\u0142o\u017cy\u0107 dla Ciebie \u015bwietny, m\u0105dry scenariusz.Czy mo\u017cesz poda\u0107 mi kilka szczeg\u00f3\u0142\u00f3w?Na przyk\u0142ad: \u201eW\u0142\u0105cz ekspres do kawy, gdy si\u0119 obudz\u0119\u201d lub \u201eCa\u0142kowicie przyciemnij \u015bwiat\u0142o, gdy ogl\u0105dam film\u201d.", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
