    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 payla\u015f": "Udost\u0119pniaj krytyczne alerty", // EN: Share critical alerts
    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "Tytu\u0142y i kr\u00f3tkie teksty zdarze\u0144 zwi\u0105zanych z bezpiecze\u0144stwem/awariami na tym urz\u0105dzeniu pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 w aplikacjach innych cz\u0142onk\u00f3w tego domu.Dane urz\u0105dzenia i klucze nigdy nie s\u0105 udost\u0119pniane;ka\u017cdy cz\u0142onek ma w\u0142asne ustawienia powiadomie\u0144.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
