    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nie uda\u0142o si\u0119 po\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 z urz\u0105dzeniem.Upewnij si\u0119, \u017ce jest w tej samej sieci.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nie uda\u0142o si\u0119 po\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 z urz\u0105dzeniem.Upewnij si\u0119, \u017ce znajduje si\u0119 w tej samej sieci oraz \u017ce adres IP i klucz lokalny s\u0105 prawid\u0142owe.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "W\u0142\u0105cza \u015bwiat\u0142a ciep\u0142\u0105 tonacj\u0105, otwiera zas\u0142ony i ustawia klimatyzacj\u0119 na 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "W\u0142\u0105cza \u015bwiat\u0142a i otwiera zas\u0142ony, ustawia klimatyzacj\u0119 na 22\u00b0 i ponownie \u0142aduje odkurzacz.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Wy\u0142\u0105cza \u015bwiat\u0142o, telewizor i klimatyzacj\u0119, zaci\u0105ga zas\u0142ony i zamyka drzwi.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Wy\u0142\u0105cza \u015bwiat\u0142o i telewizor, zaci\u0105ga zas\u0142ony i zamyka drzwi.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Ustawia o\u015bwietlenie na ciep\u0142\u0105 barw\u0119 na 15%, zaci\u0105ga zas\u0142ony i w\u0142\u0105cza telewizor.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Zamyka drzwi i zaci\u0105ga zas\u0142ony.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "W\u0142\u0105cza \u015bwiat\u0142a z jasno\u015bci\u0105 70%.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Uruchamia odkurzanie robota.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
